  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_serge_cb58ab80b2e6527ff75db3ff97da66541643d9b61806a54280a019387ee4789078">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Durable twill, of worsted or with the warp of worsted and the weft of another wool yarn, with a clear finish and a flat diagonal rib; often used for tailored garments such as suits, coats, and dresses. [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
